sequenceDiagram
    participant O as Operator
    participant R as Registry
    participant P as Private transport
    participant W as Runtime / adapter
    participant D as State store
    O->>R: Register allowed origin / profile
    R->>P: Validate DNS / TLS / route
    P->>W: Missing + wrong credential tests
    W-->>R: Protected endpoint must deny
    P->>W: Valid credential + model listing
    W-->>R: Exact model / capability identity
    R->>W: Synthetic inference qualification
    W-->>R: Result + measured evidence
    R->>D: Receipt bound to profile epochs
    R-->>O: READY only with fresh observation
    Note over O,D: Health success alone is insufficient; configuration change or restore invalidates old qualification
